  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Meet Kayla—the compact shoulder bag that’s made for nights out but is never out of place at brunch. Suede adds a little softness, while the zip closure and interior pocket keep your essentials secure. Wear it as a shoulder bag—it has a comfortable 8.5-inch drop—or use the crossbody strap to go hands-free when the evening calls for it.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Suede</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Lining: fabric</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Silver hardware</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Shoulder strap drop: 8.5&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: 1 slip pocket, 1 zip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 10.6&quot; (L) x 6.4&quot; (H) x 3.2&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
